DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261208T095200
DURATION:PT15M
SUMMARY:Quarterly board or investor update
DESCRIPTION:Ask your agent: run the board-update skill (healthcare-2027-autopilot). Eighth of the month after quarter end: draft the update while numbers are fresh.
