BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:medicaid-work-requirements-prep@healthcare-2027-autopilot
DTSTAMP:20261116T195709Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261117T073100
DURATION:PT15M
SUMMARY:Prep: Medicaid work requirements begin in 44 states
DESCRIPTION:Ask your agent: run the medicaid-coverage-guard skill (healthcare-2027-autopilot). Prepare for: Medicaid work requirements begin in 44 states. Expansion adults ages 19 to 64 must report 80 hours a month of qualifying activity. About 30% of Medicaid beneficiaries are subject. Excluded states: WY\, TX\, KS\, MS\, AL\, FL\, SC.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Prep: Medicaid work requirements begin in 44 states
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:six-month-redeterminations-prep@healthcare-2027-autopilot
DTSTAMP:20261116T195709Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261117T073100
DURATION:PT15M
SUMMARY:Prep: Six-month eligibility renewals for expansion adults
DESCRIPTION:Ask your agent: run the medicaid-coverage-guard skill (healthcare-2027-autopilot). Prepare for: Six-month eligibility renewals for expansion adults. Expansion adults are redetermined every six months instead of annually\, doubling the number of points where coverage can lapse.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Prep: Six-month eligibility renewals for expansion adults
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
