BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hold-harmless-window-prep@healthcare-2027-autopilot
DTSTAMP:20261116T195709Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261202T073100
DURATION:PT15M
SUMMARY:Prep: Optional CMS hold-harmless period on work-requirement disenrollments
DESCRIPTION:Ask your agent: run the downside-case-model skill (healthcare-2027-autopilot). Prepare for: Optional CMS hold-harmless period on work-requirement disenrollments. States that elect it must still assess compliance from January 1 but cannot deny or disenroll solely for failing the requirement until June 30\, 2027. Which states elect it changes when coverage losses hit cash.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Prep: Optional CMS hold-harmless period on work-requirement disenrollments
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:il-hb5000-prep@healthcare-2027-autopilot
DTSTAMP:20261116T195709Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261202T073100
DURATION:PT15M
SUMMARY:Prep: Illinois HB 5000 transaction notice law effective
DESCRIPTION:Ask your agent: run the deal-readiness skill (healthcare-2027-autopilot). Prepare for: Illinois HB 5000 transaction notice law effective. Notice requirement covers transactions above the facility level and expressly includes private equity companies.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Prep: Illinois HB 5000 transaction notice law effective
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
